"To qualify as a real estate professional for a tax year, you must satisfy both of these.",
"First, more than half of the personal services you perform in all trades or businesses during the year must be performed in real property trades or businesses in which you materially participate.",
"Second, you must perform more than 750 hours of service during the year in real property trades or businesses in which you materially participate.",
"The 750 hours is the easier test. A person spending 15 hours a week on real estate clears it. The more-than-half test is what disqualifies most people, because it compares real estate hours against all working hours.",
